{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22646","headline":"闻微之江陵卧病以大通中散碧腴垂云膏寄之因题四韵 · 白居易","name":"闻微之江陵卧病以大通中散碧腴垂云膏寄之因题四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已题一帖红消散，又封一合碧云英。\n凭人寄向江陵去，道路迢迢一月程。\n未必能治江上瘴，且图遥慰病中情。\n到时想得君拈得，枕上开看眼暂明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}